project_context.md
erp_questionnaire_v4.html

# Eval scoreboards are generated per run (T1.6) — recordings are checked in, results are not
/erp/assistant/evals/results/*.json

# Weekly AI ops reports are generated per run (T1.9) — not project source
/Docs/ops/*.md

# CodeGraph index cache (local tooling)
